  "slug": "copycat-panda-express-chow-mein-recipe-7556785",
  "name": "Copycat Panda Express Chow Mein",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "You can make this copycat Panda Express chow mein, the takeout menu favorite, at home in less time than it\u2019d take you to load in the car and hit the drive thru.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Heat canola oil and sesame oil in a wok over high heat. Add onion, celery, and ginger; cook, stirring often, 1 minute. Add coleslaw mix and sprouts; cook, stirring constantly, 2 minutes. Add noodles, and cook, stirring constantly, 1 minute. Add tamari and mirin; cook, stirring occasionally, 2 minutes."
    }
  ],
